    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(e)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    TSXV and Nasdaq shall have conditionally approved the Transaction and listing thereon of the Engine Shares to be issued to GameSquare
    Shareholders pursuant to the Plan of Arrangement and the Engine Shares issuable pursuant to the Replacement Options, the Replacement
