Agreement</B>&rdquo; means the Arrangement Agreement dated December 7, 2022, between Engine and GameSquare including all Schedules thereto
as filed on SEDAR and incorporated by reference in this Circular.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>


