with the Exchange Ratio (other than GameSquare Dissenting Shareholders who are ultimately entitled to receive fair value for their GameSquare
Shares in accordance with the Plan of Arrangement).</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

