                                            Common Shares and Warrants issued on September 30, 2022 were issued as units. Each unit was
                                            issued at a price of C$0.14 and consisted of one common share and 0.200669 of a purchase
                                            warrant, resulting in 6 million warrants. Each warrant entitles the holder to purchase one
                                            Common Share at an exercise price of C$0.20, commencing on September 30, 2023, and expiring
                                            on September 30, 2027.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 22.3pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

